Rule 58 (Ensure dimensions are positive)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 70 (Dimension must be less than the tensor dimension)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= v_2 < ndim(v_1)
